      "description": "Build artifacts and staging",
      "narrationSegment": "After tests pass, the pipeline builds a Docker image tagged with the commit SHA for full traceability. The image is pushed to Amazon ECR, then automatically deployed to a staging environment. Integration tests and manual QA review happen in staging before any production promotion.",
